#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:4
msgid "Switches"
msgstr "Switches"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:6
msgid ""
"``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations > (select Network Server) > "
"Switches``"
msgstr "``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations > (select Network Server) > Switches``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:9
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Visão Geral"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:11
msgid ""
"The Switches tab within a network server integration provides management "
"of network switches. Switches connect network segments and forward "
"traffic based on MAC addresses. |morpheus| syncs switch configurations "
"from supported network integrations and allows for creation, editing, and"
" management of switches directly from the UI."
msgstr "A aba Switches dentro de uma integração de servidor de rede fornece o gerenciamento de switches de rede. Switches conectam segmentos de rede e encaminham tráfego com base em endereços MAC. O |morpheus| sincroniza configurações de switch de integrações de rede suportadas e permite a criação, edição e gerenciamento de switches diretamente da UI."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:13
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:35
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:13
msgid ""
"Switch management is available on network server integrations that "
"support this capability (``hasSwitches`` flag). The tab title may vary "
"depending on the integration type."
msgstr "O gerenciamento de switches está disponível em integrações de servidor de rede que suportam essa capacidade (flag ``hasSwitches``). O título da aba pode variar dependendo do tipo de integração."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:16
msgid "Viewing Switches"
msgstr "Visualizando Switches"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:18
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:26
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:42
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:52
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations``"
msgstr "Navegue até ``Infrastructure > Network > Integrations``"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:19
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:27
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:43
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:53
msgid "Select the desired network server integration"
msgstr "Selecione a integração de servidor de rede desejada"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:20
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:28
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:44
#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:54
msgid "Click the **Switches** tab"
msgstr "Clique na aba **Switches**"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:21
msgid ""
"The list view displays switch name, description, and related "
"configuration details"
msgstr "A visualização de lista exibe o nome do switch, a descrição e detalhes de configuração relacionados"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:24
msgid "Adding a Switch"
msgstr "Adicionando um Switch"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:29
msgid "Click :guilabel:`+ ADD`"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`+ ADD`"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:30
msgid "Complete the required fields:"
msgstr "Preencha os campos obrigatórios:"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst
msgid "Name"
msgstr "Nome"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:32
msgid "A name for the switch"
msgstr "Um nome para o switch"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Descrição"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:33
msgid "(optional) A description of the switch purpose or location"
msgstr "(Opcional) Uma descrição do propósito ou localização do switch"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:35
msgid ""
"Additional fields may appear based on the network integration type and "
"its configured option types."
msgstr "Campos adicionais podem aparecer com base no tipo de integração de rede e em seus option types configurados."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:37
msgid "Click :guilabel:`CREATE`"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`CREATE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:40
msgid "Editing a Switch"
msgstr "Editando um Switch"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:45
msgid "Click the pencil (edit) icon or select the switch from the list"
msgstr "Clique no ícone de lápis (editar) ou selecione o switch na lista"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:46
msgid "Modify the desired fields"
msgstr "Modifique os campos desejados"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:47
msgid "Click :guilabel:`SAVE`"
msgstr "Clique em :guilabel:`SAVE`"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:50
msgid "Deleting a Switch"
msgstr "Excluindo um Switch"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:55
msgid "Click the trash (delete) icon for the target switch"
msgstr "Clique no ícone de lixeira (excluir) do switch de destino"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:56
msgid "Confirm the deletion when prompted"
msgstr "Confirme a exclusão quando solicitado"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:58
msgid "Warning"
msgstr "Aviso"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:58
msgid ""
"Deleting a switch will remove it from both |morpheus| and the upstream "
"network integration. Ensure no active workloads depend on the switch "
"before deletion."
msgstr "Excluir um switch o removerá tanto do |morpheus| quanto da integração de rede upstream. Certifique-se de que nenhum workload ativo dependa do switch antes da exclusão."

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:61
msgid "Required Role Permissions"
msgstr "Permissões de Função Obrigatórias"

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/network_switches.rst:63
msgid ""
"Access to switch management requires the appropriate network server "
"permissions (``infrastructure-network-integration``) with ``read`` or "
"``full`` access."
msgstr "O acesso ao gerenciamento de switches requer as permissões apropriadas do servidor de rede (``infrastructure-network-integration``) com acesso ``read`` ou ``full``."

